  <Thumbnail>7c91328d-5a1f-47da-b1b7-e2388bae54ff</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="20-08-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (documentation is a mess.  gobo 2 wheel drawing and specs suggest 8 slots but charts list 7 with slot 1 and 2 shake repeated.  Made best guess.  Similarly there are 7 colours in the colour wheel drawing and specs but 8 in the charts)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="20-08-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(CMY controls contain two sets of function ranges that conflict suggesting dependency but there are no associated controls to determine which are used)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="22-08-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="3" />
  <History Date="23-08-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Correct iris default values." Version="4" />
  <Manual Filename="" Summary="" />
  <AtlaBase TypeID="f6690879-ca50-4a41-8380-9feff508b0f4" />
